  "description": "VDocs is a high-performance, standalone .NET Word document processing framework built for developers who need complete\ncontrol over Word (DOCX) documents—without using OpenXML SDK or Microsoft Word Interop.\n\nIt features a fully custom Document Object Model (DOM) capable of mapping bidirectionally to WordprocessingML, and now\nincludes a powerful **DOM → HTML conversion engine**, enabling accurate, CSS-driven rendering of Word documents in modern\nbrowsers. This makes VDocs ideal for document rendering, reporting, automation, and export workflows.\n\nThis package is distributed under a proprietary commercial license and requires a valid license key from VegaRise.",
