  "projectUrl": "https://vegarise.com/Products/VDocs",
  "published": "2025-12-25T23:28:49.603Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "🧩 Section Abstraction and Word Mapping\n\n  - Introduced a complete section-level abstraction in the document DOM.\n\n  - Implemented accurate mapping between DOM sections and WordprocessingML sections, enabling:\n\n  - Proper section breaks\n\n  - Independent page settings per section\n\n  - Cleaner conversion logic and future format extensibility\n\n🎨 Document Page Background Support\n\n  - Added support for document-level page background configuration.\n\n  - Background color is now:\n\n  - Exposed via the public DOM API\n\n  - Correctly mapped to Word document XML\n\n  - This enables consistent page styling across generated documents.\n\n🏗️ Public API Improvements for DOM Elements\n\n  - Refined and expanded public APIs across core DOM elements.\n\n  - Improvements include:\n\n  - Clearer abstractions\n\n  - Better naming consistency\n\n  - More predictable behavior when composing documents programmatically\n\n  - These changes improve developer experience and make the DOM easier to extend and integrate.\n\n🔧 Improvements\n\n  - Cleaner separation between document model and Word-specific mapping logic\n\n  - Better internal consistency in element relationships (document → sections → pages)\n\n  - Improved readiness for upcoming HTML and multi-format conversion layers",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "VDocs - Word Document Framework",
